[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-ARI-002
VERSION: 1
TITLE: Subtraction
STATEMENT: >>>
When the service receives a valid subtraction request, the service
**shall** return the exact difference `a − b`.
<<<
KIND: functional
STATUS: draft
PRIORITY: high
SAFETY: QM
RELEASE: 1.0.0
VERIFICATION: test
VERIF_LEVELS: unit, system
TAGS: arithmetic, subtraction
SOURCE: Stakeholder request, 2026-11-18
OWNER: msforenter090
CREATED: 2026-11-18T00:00:00Z
RATIONALE: >>>
The difference of two decimal numbers always has a finite decimal form, so
it can be returned without rounding.
<<<
NOTES: >>>
- Exact means: no digit is lost or rounded, for operands of any length
  allowed by REQ-VAL-001.
<<<
